OL,3,GNEWSAFestival study tests how we find
OL,4,Afriends in crowds
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearch at Portsmouth's Victorious
OL,7,FFestival could help police and security
OL,8,Fteams find missing people in crowded
OL,9,Fspaces.
OL,11,FPsychologists from the University of
OL,12,FPortsmouth used the event to study how
OL,13,Fpeople spot friends and family members
OL,14,Fin large crowds.
OL,16,FThe researchers want to understand
OL,17,Fwhether people rely most on faces,
OL,18,Fclothing or location when searching for
OL,19,Fsomeone they know.
